OL,3,GNEWSAPausing council reorganisation an
OL,4,A'omnishambles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to pause plans to
OL,7,Freorganise local councils across Kent
OL,8,Fin light of new legal advice has
OL,9,Fprovoked a strong reaction from the
OL,10,Fcounty's political leaders.
OL,12,FUnder the Labour government's
OL,13,Fproposals, Kent County Council (KCC),
OL,14,Fthe county's district and borough
OL,15,Fcouncils and Medway Council, were due
OL,16,Fto be replaced by new unitary
OL,17,Fauthorities.
OL,19,FBut elections in May 2027 will now go
OL,20,Fahead with existing council boundaries,
OL,21,Fmeaning the existing councils will have
OL,22,Fto prepare for elections.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
