OL,3,GNEWSAPausing council reorganisation an
OL,4,A'omnishambles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader of Dartford Borough
OL,7,FCouncil, Jeremy Kite, declared the news
OL,8,Fan "omnishambles", while Labour's Vince
OL,9,FMaple, leader of Medway Council, said
OL,10,Fit was "disappointing" but tempered his
OL,11,Fcriticism.
